          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "एवाळियो (evāḷiyo) is inherited from Sanskrit avipāla, \"a shepherd\", built from avi, \"sheep\", and pāla, \"a keeper\"; CDIAL lists Marwari evāḷiyo (CDIAL 893)."
